}}" data-field="materials" bindinput="requestCorrectionInput" /></block></block><view class="schedule-toggle"><text>确认执行本次更正或删除（保存后立即生效）</text><switch disabled="{{requestBusy}}" checked="{{requestConfirmed}}" data-field="confirmed" bindchange="recordRequestInput" color="#28745c" /></view><button class="btn primary wide" disabled="{{requestBusy || !requestConfirmed}}" data-status="completed" bindtap="updateRecordRequest">执行并反馈患者</button><button class="btn ghost wide" disabled="{{requestBusy}}" data-status="rejected" bindtap="updateRecordRequest">说明原因并登记未予办理</button></block></block>
