    <block wx:elif="{{page === 'members'}}">
      <view class="back" bindtap="returnFromMembers">← 返回</view><text class="eyebrow">FAMILY MEMBERS</text><view class="title">家庭成员档案</view><view class="subtitle">当前账号管理的就诊成员；姓名相同的成员也分别保存记录。</view><view class="button-row"><button class="btn primary" bindtap="editMember">添加成员</button><button class="btn ghost" bindtap="showAcceptMemberShare">接受家人授权</button></view><view wx:if="{{members.length === 0}}" class="card empty history-space">先添加本人或家人，预约时即可直接选用资料。</view><view wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="id" class="card history-space"><view class="appointment-top"><text class="patient-name">{{item.name}} · {{item.relationship}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.enabled ? '启用' : '已停用'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.mayManage}}" class="appointment-meta">联系电话 {{item.phone}}</view><view wx:else class="slot-note">家人授权的只读档案，可查看已有及后续记录。</view><view class="work-actions"><button wx:if="{{item.mayManage}}" class="mini-btn ghost-mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editMember">编辑与启停</button><button wx:if="{{item.mayManage}}" class="mini-btn ghost-mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openMemberShares">授权管理</button><button class="mini-btn" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="viewMemberRecords">查看健康档案</button></view></view>
    </block>
