      <view class="back" bindtap="returnFromAssignment">← 返回就诊记录</view><text class="eyebrow">ASSIGN RECORD</text><view class="title">确认记录归属</view><view class="subtitle">原就诊人：{{memberAssignment.patient}}</view><view class="card history-space"><view class="field-label">归属成员</view><picker disabled="{{assignmentBusy}}" range="{{memberChoices}}" range-key="label" value="{{assignmentMemberIndex}}" bindchange="assignmentMemberChange"><view class="picker-value">{{memberChoices[assignmentMemberIndex].label}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="slot-note">将一并归属本次就诊及其关联复查记录，护理和反馈随对应就诊归入成员档案。只有当前账号已有的记录可以归属，姓名不会作为自动合并依据。</view><button class="btn primary wide" disabled="{{assignmentBusy}}" loading="{{assignmentBusy}}" bindtap="assignMember">确认归属</button></view>
    </block>
