      <view class="choices"><view class="choice {{statisticsPreset === '1' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-days="1" bindtap="statisticsPresetChange">今天</view><view class="choice {{statisticsPreset === '7' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-days="7" bindtap="statisticsPresetChange">近 7 天</view><view class="choice {{statisticsPreset === '30' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-days="30" bindtap="statisticsPresetChange">近 30 天</view></view>
      <view class="card statistics-filters"><view class="statistics-date-row"><picker mode="date" value="{{statisticsFrom}}" data-field="statisticsFrom" bindchange="statisticsDateChange"><view class="input">{{statisticsFrom}} ▾</view></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="date" value="{{statisticsTo}}" data-field="statisticsTo" bindchange="statisticsDateChange"><view class="input">{{statisticsTo}} ▾</view></picker></view><picker wx:if="{{profile.role !== 'doctor'}}" range="{{statisticsDoctors}}" value="{{statisticsDoctorIndex}}" bindchange="statisticsDoctorChange"><view class="input">{{statisticsDoctors[statisticsDoctorIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view wx:else class="appointment-meta">{{profile.doctorName}}</view><view class="slot-note">日期含起止两天，最多 90 天。可点击日期自定义范围。</view><button class="mini-btn ghost-mini" loading="{{statisticsLoading}}" disabled="{{statisticsLoading}}" bindtap="loadStatistics">刷新统计</button></view>
      <view wx:if="{{statisticsError}}" class="card empty">{{statisticsError}}<button class="btn ghost wide" bindtap="loadStatistics">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{statisticsLoading}}" class="card empty">正在汇总…</view>
      <block wx:elif="{{statistics}}">
        <view class="slot-note">{{statistics.doctor}} · 更新于 {{statistics.updatedAt}}</view>
        <view class="section-title">预约日期内的当前进度</view>
        <view class="statistics-grid"><view class="stat"><text>预约总数</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.appointments.total}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text>已到店（含完成）</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.appointments.arrived}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text>接诊已完成</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.appointments.completed}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text>到店进度</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.appointments.arrivalRate}}</text></view></view>
        <view class="statistics-grid"><view class="stat"><text>取消率</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.cancellationRate}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text>爽约率</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.noShowRate}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text>已结束预约到店率</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.finalArrivalRate}}</text></view></view><view class="slot-note">已结束预约到店率仅统计已完成与已标记爽约的预约；尚未结束的预约不纳入分母。</view><view class="card history-space"><view class="card-title">预约来源</view><view wx:for="{{statistics.bookingSources}}" wx:key="label" class="slot-note">{{item.label}} · {{item.count}}</view></view><view class="slot-note">按计划预约日期筛选，状态截至当前。到店进度 = 已到店（含完成）÷ 未取消预约（{{statistics.appointments.arrivalDenominator}} 条）。包含尚未确认、取消申请中及未来预约，不代表最终到诊率。</view>
