        <view class="section-title">期间实际发生</view><view class="stats"><view class="stat"><text>到店</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.activity.arrived}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text>完成接诊</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.activity.completed}}</text></view><view class="stat"><text>取消</text><text class="stat-value">{{statistics.activity.cancelled}}</text></view></view><view class="slot-note">按状态变更事件的实际时间统计，与计划预约日期无关；缺少历史事件的旧记录不会补算。</view>
