      <view class="card work-range"><picker wx:if="{{profile.role !== 'doctor'}}" range="{{workDoctors}}" value="{{workDoctorIndex}}" bindchange="workDoctorChange"><view class="input">{{workDoctors[workDoctorIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view wx:else class="appointment-meta">{{profile.doctorName}} · 仅本人</view><view class="field-label">事项日期范围</view><view class="record-date-row"><picker mode="date" value="{{workFrom}}" data-field="workFrom" bindchange="workDateChange"><view class="input">{{workFrom || '开始日期'}} ▾</view></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="date" value="{{workTo}}" data-field="workTo" bindchange="workDateChange"><view class="input">{{workTo || '结束日期'}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="slot-note">预约按预约日期、护理按反馈日期、复查按建议日期筛选，含起止两天。未填表示不限。</view><button class="mini-btn ghost-mini" bindtap="resetWorkFilters">重置全部筛选</button></view>
